WEBVTT

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:05.860
<i>Seth reunited with his friends
 in Caislean Merlin,</i>

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.440
<i>but Melie rejected Seth,</i>

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.470
<i>and the two were left at odds
 with each other.</i>

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:17.660
<i>Seth then rejoined the young
 Knight-sorcerer apprentice, Ocoho,</i>

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.660
<i>who gave him information 
on the castle archive</i>

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:23.030
<i>which may hold clues about Radiant.</i>

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:05.460
I've been having that dream 
over and over lately.

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:08.930
What's going on?

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:47.020
<b>His Name Is 
-Diabal-</b>

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:44.070
<i>"His Name Is."</i>

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:57.030
Done!

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:08.040
Lady Alma!
 The communications feather is stirring!

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.570
Stop shouting, damn it!

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:11.880
Pout...

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:14.880
Get over it!
 Just bring me my new outfit already!

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.840
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:23.840
<i>Alma!</i>

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.890
Well, if it isn't Seth.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:28.700
This is the second time you've contacted me
 since you reached the castle.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:30.850
Nice to know you're safe.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:34.610
Last time, you told me you'd been in a fight
 with the Merchant Barons,

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:39.890
and then fought some giant Nemesis
 you called a "Spectre."

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:42.080
So, what did you do this time?

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.110
Did you destroy the castle?

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:46.620
<i>Of course not!
 I didn't do anything that crazy.</i>

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.610
Is that really true?

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:52.120
Making trouble is the one thing
 you're exceptionally good at, you know?

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:53.910
<i>Yes, it's true!</i>

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:56.220
<i>I'm just training with Ocoho, that's all!</i>

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:59.750
<i>Well, more like Ocoho keeps beating
 me up all the time, actually.</i>

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:05.510
Listen to you... Have you forgotten
 why you went there in the first place?

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:06.500
<i>Huh?</i>

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.590
Aren't you there to investigate Radiant?

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:13.140
Not that you had a lot of brains to begin with,
 but have you lost even more?

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:16.040
I-I'm still investigating!

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:20.130
I look at the books and documents 
Ocoho brings me every day,

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:23.530
but it's no use.
 I can't find any leads at all.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:27.910
<i>If you could find information about Radiant
 in a book, life would be easy.</i>

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:32.410
Maybe the only way really is 
to sneak into the archive.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:37.720
<i>Do you think the Caislean Merlin castle archive
 would be that easy to get into?</i>

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:40.170
Just leave it to me! I have a plan!

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:41.650
<i>A plan?</i>

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:48.680
<i>I don't expect much of a plan
 thought up by someone with straw for brains.</i>

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:51.680
<i>Where's Melie?</i>

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:57.000
Melie's... taking some training course 
that some popular knight apprentices

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:00.070
called "Marmot" and "Sunglasses"
 are involved in.

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:03.820
<i>Oh? So you're actually seeing her regularly?</i>

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.320
<i>That's a step forward, then.</i>

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.950
Uh... I wouldn't say I see her regularly.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:10.580
I just kind of see her from a distance.

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.340
Why won't you talk to her?!

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:17.090
Stop pussyfooting around! 
You're driving me nuts!

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:20.080
B-But what am I supposed to say?!

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:22.620
If you can't figure that much out,
 what hope do you have?!

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:24.760
You fool! Idiot! Moron!

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.680
<i>Hey, Alma...</i>

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:30.760
<i>Have you and I ever been 
to Caislean Merlin before?</i>

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:33.330
I don't think so.

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:35.010
Why? What happened?

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:37.030
<i>Well, it's weird.</i>

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:40.020
<i>I feel like I know this castle.</i>

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:41.900
Say what?

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:45.250
Every night, I have this dream 
about a passageway inside.

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:47.590
Ever since I got here,

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:50.590
memories that I don't even
 know about keep surfacing.

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:55.830
Someone's here.
 I'll call you again later.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:59.030
<i>Seth, whatever you do, 
don't do anything stupid.</i>

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:01.970
<i>And call me more often!</i>

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:04.310
All right, I will. Bye.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:10.680
<i>Ocoho and... Marmot?</i>

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:13.100
<i>Aren't they supposed to be doing drills now?</i>

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:16.600
<i>What are they talking about?</i>

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:29.620
<i>D-Did I just see something 
I wasn't supposed to?</i>

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:33.990
Ah, u-um...

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.270
Sorry! I wasn't trying to peep!

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:42.260
Ocoho?

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:49.100
Something seemed... weird.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:59.050
Did you hear?
 Dullahan showed up again last night.

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:00.340
Again?

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:03.770
This country sure has turned 
into a dangerous place.

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:11.280
I'm off to my knight training course now.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:14.280
Oh... You're feeling okay now?

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:15.820
What do you mean?

00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:18.780
Uh, nothing! I'm glad you're okay.

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:20.600
Be careful out there.

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:21.410
I will!

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:24.570
And don't eat any weird things you find
 lying on the ground, okay?

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:26.610
I'm not gonna do that!

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:28.900
What did you say?!

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:40.840
Melie's trying to act cheerful,

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:43.730
but she's still thinking about
 what happened with Seth.

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:48.830
Bah! Fretting over it won't help!

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:51.300
I'm going out
 into town myself for once!

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.220
Darn that Draccoon.

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:01.830
Ever since I indulged him that one time,
 he always wants more.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.700
Honestly...

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:15.870
Some things never change.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:20.810
You're still doing that 
every morning, Sagramore?

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:21.930
Yeah.

00:08:24.010 --> 00:08:27.550
Training in the basics
 is the foundation of knighthood.

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:31.440
I can't neglect a single day.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:35.070
That serious side of you 
hasn't changed at all.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:37.030
Ever since we were kids,

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:40.400
you've always been the most responsible
 of the three of us.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:41.620
Of course.

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:45.650
Being Knight-sorcerer apprentices 
comes with responsibilities.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:47.580
Well, yeah. I know, but...

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:49.450
Ocoho,

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:52.840
don't you think you've been slacking a bit
 since the queen complimented you?

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.560
Excuse me?!

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:56.840
Want to test me right here, then?

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:58.720
Fine.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:00.930
Okay, here I come!

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:03.730
Is that all you've got?!

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:11.860
So that's the archive.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:13.860
A good day to you.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.360
Thanks.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.770
He hasn't looked up 
from that scroll once.

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:20.980
He won't notice
 if I go in wearing this.

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:24.500
Now's my chance!

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:26.870
A good day to you.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:27.750
Hi.

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:29.880
A good day to you.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.500
Thanks.

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:34.010
One moment.

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:39.080
Your name is not appearing 
on my magic scroll.

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:41.260
It appears you have not followed 
the proper procedure.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:45.110
Th-That's odd... I-I wonder why.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:47.700
<i>Crap! Gotta think up an excuse, fast!</i>

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:49.360
<i>Quickly, quickly! Anything!</i>

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:52.400
<i>Um, um, um, um...</i>

00:09:56.390 --> 00:09:57.780
My list!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.210
Someone, help! Intruder!

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:01.600
An intruder?!

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:02.910
Get him!

00:10:04.230 --> 00:10:05.910
<i>I screwed up!</i>

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:08.170
Capture the intruder!

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:10.410
<i>Those guys never give up!</i>

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:12.170
This passageway...

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:14.540
I've seen it somewhere before.

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:15.170
He's heading for a dead end!

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:19.800
The symbol I saw in my dream!

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.380
There he is!

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:22.550
We've got him cornered!

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:27.510
H-He vanished?

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:29.440
Impossible!

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:32.340
He must be nearby! 
Split up and find him!

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:33.650
Where'd he go?!

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:43.290
What's going on?

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:46.580
I drew the character I saw in my dream,
 and I passed through the wall.

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:52.460
It's kinda cramped in here.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:59.240
Is this a hidden passage?

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:01.400
Where does it lead?

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:11.900
Am I inside the castle's walls?

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:15.380
So I can go anywhere from here.

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:17.570
It might even be connected to the archive!

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:33.900
I'm... inside the castle, right?

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:43.690
Ugh, it's filthy in here.

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:44.930
What is this place?

00:11:57.390 --> 00:12:00.440
This place is kinda creepy.

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:08.260
Who's that?

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.810
The Nemesis from before?

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:16.330
But it's smaller.

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:17.590
Who's there?!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:19.340
Crap!

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:21.840
Canfod!

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:26.350
A young boy...

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:28.610
Average physique.

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:30.520
He appears to be unarmed.

00:12:31.380 --> 00:12:33.230
<i>Is he inspecting me?</i>

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:35.430
A small stone in his left pocket.

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:36.730
And...

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.730
What? H-Horns?!

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:44.990
No! It can't be!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:46.280
Is it him?!

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:48.490
I thought I got away from him!

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:50.100
H-Hey!

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:50.990
Stay away!

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:54.900
This hidden place was supposed to be safe!

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:57.190
Now I have no choice but to kill myself!

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:58.570
Hey, calm down!

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:00.840
I think you're mistaking me
 for someone else!

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:04.470
I don't even know you.
 I just ended up here by accident!

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.180
Liar! You won't fool me!

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:09.480
I would never mistake those horns!

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:12.720
I don't know how you found me,

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.420
but I won't let you kill me, Piodon!

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:16.730
"Piodon"?

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:19.680
I have to call for help!

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:22.980
But how am I supposed 
to get away from him?!

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:26.770
Did you just say "Piodon"?

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:28.740
Do you know who he—

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:29.870
No...

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.490
The process has already begun.

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:34.500
I have no choice!

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:39.380
What is—

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:43.260
I'm closed in?!

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:46.950
Hey, wait!

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:49.140
I'm not your enemy! Let me out!

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:51.360
What did you just do?!

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:54.140
Get back here! Let me out of—

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:06.030
<b>[Magic Stone of Armor] 
A magic stone stored in a Knight-sorcerer's armor.
 Because it is very precious, you will get scolded if you lose it.</b>

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.930
I-It's a Spectre!

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:16.410
Run! Get away from the fields!

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:22.210
I-It's a giant Spectre Nemesis!

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:24.060
It appeared out of nowhere!

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:26.390
I found it first!

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:29.180
I'm gonna name it "Spectrolom"!

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.580
Wow, it's so big!

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:34.450
Go catch it for me, too!

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:36.680
W-W-W-W-We should run away!

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:40.310
No. Actually, we should 
stay where we are.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:45.570
That may be the trigger to the very thing
 we've been waiting for.

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:50.070
Dragunov...

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.990
Is that the Spectre Nemesis 
we've heard about?

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:55.080
What shall we do?

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:59.830
You're asking for directions 
from the newest Thaumaturge?

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.900
We are of equal status right now.

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:06.300
Besides, I know very well
 how accurate your insight is,

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:08.470
as your former subordinate.

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:11.220
"Accurate," eh?

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:17.110
What is that?

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:19.130
I'm... standing there?

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:23.980
So is this thing creating the Spectres?

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:26.530
It replicates whatever's inside here?

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:32.740
The house!
 My kids are still in the house!

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:36.210
This is bad! If I take even one step,

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:38.450
I'll trample all of them!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.430
Don't move... Don't move!

00:15:40.950 --> 00:15:43.090
I have to find a way.

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:46.800
<i>Watch it! Here comes another one!</i>

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:01.170
Poison...

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:07.530
The Spectre's gonna fall!

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:08.980
Run away!

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:20.110
This is an emergency!

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:24.330
Spectre Nemesis sighted 
twelve leagues east of Sylverive!

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:27.030
Those who are ready, 
depart immediately!

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:29.220
Those who aren't ready, 
depart immediately anyway!

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:31.720
Fall behind and you'll answer to my fists!

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:34.840
Are you kidding me? 
We're deploying <i>now</i>?!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:38.470
What about Seth?
 Where is he, and what's he doing?

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:41.470
I left my armor with him!

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:43.140
Mordred!

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:47.070
Why are there trainees here?

00:16:47.070 --> 00:16:50.380
They were already here 
to observe military exercises,

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:53.740
and since it's an emergency, 
I thought they could help.

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:55.220
Absolutely not!

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:57.140
Her Majesty the Queen insisted.

00:16:57.140 --> 00:16:59.100
Then they're all welcome!

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:00.870
Where is Sagramore?

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:03.620
He should be here at any moment.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.370
What?!

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:08.810
I haven't seen Lord de Gulis, 
and Sagramore's missing, too?!

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:11.500
Those Nemesis aren't going to wait
 for us, you know!

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:13.510
"Those"?

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:16.440
The man on watch said 
there were two of them.

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:19.980
Two at once is... Oh, great Merlin!

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:24.830
The only ones who have defeated
 a Spectre are you,

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:26.760
Sagramore, and Lord de Gulis.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:29.020
We lack the manpower 
to fight without them.

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:32.250
We have lost many Knights-sorcerers 
and apprentices

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:34.650
in battles against Spectres.

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:37.980
I don't have another partner for you.

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:40.230
If Mordred needs a partner...

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.630
I'll do it.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:55.100
Who are you?

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:56.890
I'm Ocoho!

00:17:56.890 --> 00:17:58.930
I've been here for three years!

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:02.930
Oh, yes. The apprentice
 who somehow earned the queen's favor.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:06.560
Ocoho, you shouldn't do this.
 It's dangerous.

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:08.720
We're short on fighters, aren't we?

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:10.870
There could be massive losses!

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:12.820
I can't just wait around and do nothing!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:15.820
I've trained along with you all this time!

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:16.940
But...

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:19.890
Mordred is right.

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:23.370
But it's true that we're short on fighters.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.430
If you're volunteering, I'll allow it.

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:30.460
All right, everyone! Let's move!

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:31.950
Yes, sir!

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:36.770
What's wrong, Mordred?

00:18:36.770 --> 00:18:38.950
Oh, uh... nothing.

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:42.940
Would you lead the trainees for me?

00:18:42.940 --> 00:18:45.600
I'm going to get my dragon ready.

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:46.850
I'll catch up soon.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:50.230
It's a real fight.

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:52.230
I'm gonna do my best.

00:18:52.930 --> 00:18:55.820
Okay, you all have your brooms, right?

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:57.030
Yes, ma'am!

00:18:57.390 --> 00:19:00.180
We're sort of plunging you into this,
 but don't worry!

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:03.370
Just do your best to keep up, 
and don't lose sight of me.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.780
Yes, ma'am!

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:22.860
Huh? It's not falling on us?

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:24.050
It's stopped!

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:25.230
We're saved!

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:27.330
The great Merlin has blessed us!

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:37.530
I'm going numb.

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:40.820
My body...
 won't do what I tell it to.

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:45.150
What's going on?

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:48.080
Why isn't it attacking me again?

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:57.090
<i>It reacts to movement?</i>

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:02.430
<i>I can't... keep this up.</i>

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:06.220
<i>But... I can't fall, no matter what!</i>

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:14.340
It seems you've been caught up 
in some trouble yet again, Seth.

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:19.730
And this time, there is nothing 
Grimm can do for you.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:21.740
But...

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:26.240
Perhaps Grimm can at least stop
 this projection magic.

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:31.250
There must be a device somewhere 
that's projecting this image.

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:37.250
What do you plan to do
 when we get there, Dragunov?

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:40.760
Fulfill my duty as an Inquisitor, 
and nothing more.

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:42.880
Our top priority is
 to save people's lives.

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:46.780
Our only mission is
 to capture the horned sorcerer

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:49.860
and his companions, dead or alive.

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:53.390
We have no authority
 to cause an incident in Cyfandir.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:58.900
As Thaumaturges, we never received 
an order to save any lives.

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:01.150
I don't care about orders!

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:04.650
I see you haven't changed.

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:15.160
Dragons... The Knights-Sorcerers?

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:38.030
That's a Spectre?

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:39.940
But it sort of looks...

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:43.860
Spectres always look weird,

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:47.200
but I've never seen one 
leaning like that!

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:51.020
Okay, Draccoon! Let's show them 
how hard we've been training!

00:21:51.020 --> 00:21:55.230
We've shed blood, sweat, and tears,
 all for this very day!

00:21:56.700 --> 00:21:58.780
I'll knock that Spectre into orbit

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:01.460
and show everyone just how strong I am!

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:12.970
Seth!

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:13.970
Huh?!

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:29.990
To Be Continued

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:20.790
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:00.810 --> 00:24:04.670
<i>A Spectre Nemesis in the form
 of Seth has appeared.</i>

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:07.650
<i>What is the objective of the man
 who's controlling it</i>

00:24:07.650 --> 00:24:10.010
<i>from his hiding place 
deep below the castle?</i>

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:14.900
<i>Meanwhile, Seth blacks out and finds himself
 trapped in an eerie realm.</i>

00:24:14.900 --> 00:24:16.780
<i>It is the realm of consciousness.</i>

00:24:16.780 --> 00:24:20.020
<i>Seth is at the mercy of the dark power
 lurking within him.</i>

00:24:20.490 --> 00:24:23.410
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>, 
"The Spectre Battle."</i>

00:24:20.790 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>The Spectre Battle 
-Spectre-</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>Watch for more Bravery next time!!</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>End</b>
